              "sender_id": 79,
              "subject": "Re: Can you recommend some songs?",
              "body": "Sure! These are all of my favorite songs.\n- Bleeding Sun by Aria Sterling\n- The Unseen Scars of Love by Lucas Grey, Velvet Echo\n- Whispers of the Heart by Lily Moon, Zoey James\n- Wandering Hearts by Astrid Nightshade\n- The Spiral of Unending Thoughts by Carter Knight\n- Wandering Through Time's Embrace by Lucas Diaz, Orion Steele\n- Siren's Call by Luna Starlight\n- The Unbearable Lightness of Loss by Zoe Mitchell\n- Love's Last Lonely Mile by Velvet Echo\n- Chasing the Ghosts of Yesterday by Jasper Skye, Isabella Cruz, Seraphina Dawn\n- When Angels Weep for Us by Lucas Grey, Velvet Echo\n- Cracks in the Facade of Love by Velvet Echo\n- Whispers of the Enchanted Forest by Aria Sterling\n- Silent Tears by Seraphina Dawn\n- Swept Away by Jasper Skye\n- Walking Through the Valley of Shadows by Lily Moon, Zoey James\nHope you like them!",
              "response_to_email_id": 20867
            }
